diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 41b8906..cb8b928 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -236,6 +236,19 @@ enabled using `powerprofilesctl`:
 powerprofilesctl configure-action amdgpu_dpm --enable
 ```
 
+## Panel dimming
+
+A DRM driver other than amdgpu may give its panel's connector the same
+`panel_power_savings` attribute, in a group named after the driver (the Apple
+silicon display driver's `apple/panel_power_savings`). The `panel_dim` action
+writes 1 to it on battery and in the "power-saver" profile, and 0 otherwise,
+as macOS dims its panel on battery and in Low Power mode. It is enabled by
+default, and can be disabled by running:
+
+```sh
+powerprofilesctl configure-action panel_dim --disable
+```
+
 ## Multiple driver and multiple action operations
 
 Power-profiles daemon will load all supported drivers and actions by default.
